    "### Build the decision prompt\n",
    "\n",
    "This function constructs the information-exposure prompt seen by one agent.\n",
    "\n",
    "It combines:\n",
    "- the agent profile;\n",
    "- the stimulus;\n",
    "- source and social context;\n",
    "- timestep/network information; and\n",
    "- the restricted `SHARE` / `IGNORE` / `VERIFY` response format.\n",
    "\n",
    "A strict output format makes LLM behaviour quantifiable.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "id": "75aa073f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def create_llm_decision_prompt(\n",
    "    agent,\n",
    "    information,\n",
    "    social_context,\n",
    "):\n",
    "    return f\"\"\"\n",
    "You are Agent {agent['agent_id']} in an academic social-media information-cascade simulation.\n",
    "\n",
    "PROFILE\n",
    "Age group: {agent['age']}\n",
    "Gender: {agent['gender']}\n",
    "Education: {agent['education']}\n",
    "Occupation: {agent['occupation']}\n",
    "Political leaning: {agent['political_leaning']}\n",
    "\n",
    "BIG FIVE SCORES (0 to 1)\n",
    "Openness: {agent['openness']:.2f}\n",
    "Conscientiousness: {agent['conscientiousness']:.2f}\n",
    "Extraversion: {agent['extraversion']:.2f}\n",
    "Agreeableness: {agent['agreeableness']:.2f}\n",
    "Neuroticism: {agent['neuroticism']:.2f}\n",
    "\n",
    "BEHAVIOURAL ATTRIBUTES\n",
    "Trust: {agent['trust_level']:.2f}\n",
    "Scepticism: {agent['scepticism']:.2f}\n",
    "Digital literacy: {agent['digital_literacy']:.2f}\n",
    "\n",
    "POST\n",
    "Title: {information['title']}\n",
    "Content: {information['content']}\n",
    "Topic: {information['topic']}\n",
    "Emotional intensity: {information['emotional_intensity']}\n",
    "Source credibility: {information['source_credibility']}\n",
    "\n",
    "SOCIAL CONTEXT\n",
    "{social_context}\n",
    "\n",
    "Choose exactly one action:\n",
    "SHARE\n",
    "IGNORE\n",
    "VERIFY\n",
    "\n",
    "Respond in exactly this format:\n",
    "Decision: SHARE\n",
    "Reason: one short natural-language sentence\n",
    "\n",
    "Replace SHARE with IGNORE or VERIFY when appropriate.\n",
    "Do not mention the numeric personality scores in the reason.\n",
    "\"\"\".strip()\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def extract_decision(text):\n",
    "    text = str(text).strip()\n",
    "\n",
    "    match = re.search(\n",
    "        r\"Decision\\s*:\\s*(SHARE|IGNORE|VERIFY)\",\n",
    "        text,\n",
    "        flags=re.IGNORECASE,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "    if match:\n",
    "        return match.group(1).upper()\n",
    "\n",
    "    upper = text.upper()\n",
    "\n",
    "    for label in [\"SHARE\", \"VERIFY\", \"IGNORE\"]:\n",
    "        if label in upper:\n",
    "            return label\n",
    "\n",
    "    return \"UNKNOWN\"\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def extract_reason(text):\n",
    "    match = re.search(\n",
    "        r\"Reason\\s*:\\s*(.+)\",\n",
    "        str(text),\n",
    "        flags=re.IGNORECASE | re.DOTALL,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "    if not match:\n",
    "        return \"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    return match.group(1).strip()[:500]"
   ]
  },
