    "# Phase 5 - LangGraph Information-Cascade Simulation\n",
    "\n",
    "This phase defines one consistent production simulation engine.\n",
    "\n",
    "The earlier project errors occurred because several incompatible versions of the graph and `run_experiment` functions were present at the same time. This notebook defines each function once.\n",
