    "- Provides a small smoke test before the full experiment.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Main outputs.** A compiled LangGraph workflow and `run_single_simulation()`-style execution logic that returns cascade and decision logs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Run note.** The smoke test is intended to validate mechanics cheaply. It should succeed before any large Ollama experiment is launched.\n"
