    "# Phase 6 - Agent-to-Agent Communication\n",
    "\n",
    "The decision log is converted into explicit source→target communication links. Successful `SHARE` actions reconstruct the information-cascade graph.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Phase Notes\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose.** Convert decision logs into explicit agent-to-agent communication links.\n",
    "\n",
    "**What this phase does**\n",
    "- Reads the recorded source agent and exposed target agent.\n",
    "- Treats successful sharing as a directed information-transfer link.\n",
    "- Creates a communication table that can later be used for influence and network analyses.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Main output.** A source→target communication log derived from actual simulation decisions.\n"
   ]
