    "# Phase 27 - Qualitative Analysis of LLM Reasons\n",
    "\n",
    "Real sentiment analysis (VADER) is applied to every free-text `Reason` field, giving a\n",
    "continuous polarity score rather than a hand-coded keyword flag. An optional zero-shot\n",
    "classification pass (toggle-controlled, since it is slow) further labels each reason\n",
    "into rhetorical categories (e.g. cautionary, alarmist, dismissive, reassuring) using a\n",
    "pretrained NLI model, addressing the supervisor's request for sentiment/zero-shot\n",
    "analysis of agent-generated text.\n",
    "\n",
